"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Additional properties {#additional-properties}"
msgstr "その他のプロパティ {#additional-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"clops\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"CLOPS (or CLOPS_h)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"clops\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"CLOPS（またはCLOPS_h）\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Circuit layer operations per second (CLOPS) is a measure of how many layers "
"of a 100x100 circuit (hardware-aware circuit) a QPU can execute per unit of "
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit Layer Operations Per "
"Second（CLOPS）は、QPUが単位時間あたりに実行できる100×100回路（ハードウェア対応回路）のレイヤー数を測定します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Calculate with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>Find the [CLOPS code](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-device-benchmarking/tree/main/qiskit_device_benchmarking/clops#readme) in the Qiskit Community GitHub</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"status\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Status\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Qiskitで計算</th>\n"
"      <td>Qiskit Community GitHubに[CLOPSコード](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-device-benchmarking/tree/main/qiskit_device_benchmarking/clops#readme)があります</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">IBM Quantum Platformで表示</th>\n"
"      <td>「詳細」セクション</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"status\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"ステータス\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With [`BackendStatus`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/models-backend-status), you can find the QPU status (for example, "
"`Active`, `Paused`, `Offline`) as well as the number of pending jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[`BackendStatus`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/models-backend-status)を使用して、QPUのステータス（例: "
"`Active`、`Paused`、`Offline`）および保留中のジョブ数を確認できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`print(backend.status().status_msg)`, `print(backend.status().pending_jobs)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"coupling-map\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Topology diagram or coupling map\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Qiskitで表示</th>\n"
"      <td>`print(backend.status().status_msg)`、`print(backend.status().pending_jobs)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">IBM Quantum Platformで表示</th>\n"
"      <td>「詳細」セクション</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"coupling-map\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"トポロジー図またはカップリングマップ\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A diagram that indicates the pairs of qubits that support two-qubit gate operations between them. This is also called the coupling map or connectivity. Qubits are represented as circles and the supported two-qubit gate operations are displayed as lines connecting the qubits.\n"
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`from qiskit.visualization import plot_gate_map` then `plot_gate_map(backend)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section; Click on Expand for a larger view </td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"What does `error = 1` mean?\">\n"
"   If the benchmarking of a qubit or edge does not succeed over the course of several days, whether due to poor data quality or other internal factors, the reported error value is considered stale and will be reported as 1. This is not an indication that the qubit or edge is necessarily non-working or that the error is 1; rather, the error is considered undefined and you should proceed with caution when operating that qubit or gate.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"2量子ビットゲート演算をサポートする量子ビットのペアを示す図です。カップリングマップまたは接続性とも呼ばれます。量子ビットは円で表され、サポートされる2量子ビットゲート演算は量子ビットを結ぶ線で表示されます。\n"
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Qiskitで表示</th>\n"
"      <td>`from qiskit.visualization import plot_gate_map`の後に`plot_gate_map(backend)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">IBM Quantum Platformで表示</th>\n"
"      <td>「キャリブレーションデータ」セクション。「展開」をクリックして拡大表示</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"「error = 1」とはどういう意味ですか？\">\n"
"   データの品質が低いなどの内部要因により、量子ビットまたはエッジのベンチマーキングが数日間成功しない場合、報告されるエラー値は古いものとみなされ、1として報告されます。これは量子ビットまたはエッジが必ずしも機能していないこと、またはエラーが1であることを示すものではありません。むしろ、エラーは未定義とみなされるため、その量子ビットまたはゲートを使用する際には注意が必要です。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "次のステップ {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to [build noise models](/guides/build-noise-models) to do noisy classical simulation.\n"
"- Review the [Transpiler stages](/guides/transpiler-stages) topic to learn about how the transpiler uses backend properties for circuit optimization.\n"
"- Review the [QiskitRuntime backend API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"おすすめ\">\n"
"- ノイズのある古典シミュレーションを行うための[ノイズモデルの構築](/guides/build-noise-models)方法を学びます。\n"
"- トランスパイラーが回路最適化にバックエンドプロパティを使用する方法については、[トランスパイラーの段階](/guides/transpiler-stages)トピックを参照してください。\n"
"- [QiskitRuntimeバックエンドAPI](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)リファレンスを確認してください。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
